# App runtime store — the token ledger and the test suite's scratch EverOS
# root. Beliefs live outside the repo in EVEROS_ROOT (~/.everos by default);
# fresh clones re-seed from data/concepts/ and the dry-run proof.
data/store/

# Deploy secrets and per-deployment state — never tracked. The initial commit
# swept a key pair in before these patterns existed (see the removal commit);
# any future deploy generates fresh ones and they stay out of the repo.
deploy/*.pem
deploy/.state/
deploy/*.tgz

